{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/247362-heaven-s-reach-uninfected-solars","id":247362,"title":"Heaven's Reach: Uninfected Solars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-02T19:48:36-07:00","id":247362,"title":"Heaven's Reach: Uninfected Solars","content":"In the Heaven's reach shard, it's mentioned that most returned solars were diminished by the methods they used to defeat the Yozi infection. <br /> <br /> So mechanically, what would a solar who hadn't been diminished be like? Just able to increase his essence beyond five?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T19:55:40-07:00","id":247386,"title":"","content":"'Can increase their Essence beyond five, but suffer from the Great Curse' was the generally-accepted way of keeping it simple and straightforward, from what I last recall. Of course, more esoteric variations might be designed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T05:36:51-07:00","id":247758,"title":"","content":"Of course, the Great Curse never did mechanically model the behavior of the ancient Solars who were supposed to suffer from it, so you might want to wing it narratively...I imagine there are entire planets full of charm-crazed aliens fanatically worshipping their Essence 8-10 God Kings somewhere off the galactic map. <br /> <br /> Of course, this also introduces the problem of properly scaling high-essence charms to a space opera context: Can a Solar's Social magic dominate only a city, or a continent? An entire hemisphere or planet? A solar system or an entire section of the galaxy? How much is too much, and where to draw the line? <br /> <br /> Pretty sure that's why HR has the Ess 5 cap. Although it's unclear if ALL Exalted have that, or just Solars...Probably best to assume it's for all, even if that makes SMA problematic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T08:04:08-07:00","id":247859,"title":"","content":"Since undiminished Solars are NPCs, I would treat what they can do as plot powers, as extensive as they need to be. Which could be very extensive if to challenge a bunch of Essence 5 Solars or something.<br /> <br /> I'd also make them really insane, just to highlight how fucked up the Yozis virus made them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}